@baseUrl = http://localhost:3010
@apiVersion = v1
@accessToken =

### List alarms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/alarms
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Alarm history (24h | 168 | 720)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/alarms/history?hours=24
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Alarm frequency
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/alarms/summary?hours=24
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Alarm history CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/alarms/history.csv?hours=24
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
